4. Facilitate access to information: Our expertise in AI/ML systems, particularly with models like Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3, CamemBERT, and Falcon, along with our experience in data engineering, positions us well to facilitate access to information. This aspect can be considered FULLY COVERED.

