Proposed Architecture:
To meet these requirements, we propose an architecture that leverages our AI/ML stack for facilitating access to information and ensuring explicability. The system would be built on top of a cloud infrastructure (utilizing providers like OVHcloud or Scaleway, which align with the sovereignty requirement) to ensure high availability and scalability.

